### Recommendation endpoint — example request
### Use with the VS Code "REST Client" extension.
### Get accessToken from POST /api/auth/login first (see auth.http).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@accessToken = $2b$10$GN9hi0LdALtVdW/vo.SjS.y0KAPZQb8n6FNaZeuxKqwc7I22l7BHm

### Get the best card recommendation for a spend category
GET {{baseUrl}}/recommendation?category=dining&amount=1500
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
